00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.610
I don't know.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.680
I started out on the side of music

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.040
maybe that had something to do with it.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.358
I was obsessed with the sound of music

00:00:11.358 --> 00:00:13.840
word for word, I could recite everything.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.240
But I was, when I was young,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.890
