00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.880
I used to go out on my balcony in Nigeria,

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:31.800
we have this balcony with no railings

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.400
and it was right in front of a main street

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.233
in front of bar beach,

00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:36.350
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.160
and I'd stand there...

